  "priorExpiration": "2018-10-01",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fam 406.01 Obligation to Keep Information Current. A family mediator shall advise the board promptly of changes in the following information:\n\n(a) The family mediator's legal name;\n\n(b) The family mediator's home mailing address or home telephone number;\n\n(c) The name of the family mediator's mediation business; and\n\n(d) The mailing address, e-mail address, or telephone number of the mediation business.\n\nSource. #9672, eff 4-2-10; ss by #12507, INTERIM, eff 4-2-18, EXPIRED: 10-1-18\n\nNew. #12635, eff 10-2-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/fam100-800.html"
